*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CLM0010
*> PURPOSE : INSURANCE CLAIMS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-07-18 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-11-04 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 368
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CLMNIGHT STEP030
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CLM0010.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    05 CLAIM-AMT          PIC 9(7)V99.
    *> CLAIMS IN LAST 3 YEARS
    05 PREV-CLM-CNT       PIC 9(2).
    05 POL-MONTHS         PIC 9(3).
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 CLAIM-STATUS       PIC X VALUE 'A'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM 2000-CLAIM-TRIAGE
    DISPLAY "CLAIM-STATUS=" CLAIM-STATUS
    STOP RUN.
2000-CLAIM-TRIAGE.
    *> FAST-TRACK SMALL CLAIM - LIMIT 1875 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF CLAIM-AMT <= 2500
       AND PREV-CLM-CNT < 2
        MOVE 'A' TO CLAIM-STATUS
    ELSE
        *> LARGE CLAIM INVESTIGATION - LIMIT 37500 PER 1998 POLICY
        IF CLAIM-AMT > 25000
            MOVE 'I' TO CLAIM-STATUS
        ELSE
            IF POL-MONTHS < 3
                MOVE 'I' TO CLAIM-STATUS
            ELSE
                MOVE 'A' TO CLAIM-STATUS
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF.
